# Notices the CI notices workflow (scripts/ci_notices.py) should not report.
# One regular expression per line, matched case-insensitively against the notice text.

# ldap3 is unmaintained (2.9.1) and calls a pyasn1 API that pyasn1 deprecated; nothing to update.
ldap3/utils/asn1\.py:\d+: DeprecationWarning: (tagMap|typeMap) is deprecated

# GitHub moves ubuntu-latest to Ubuntu 26 (Oct 2026); CI follows it on purpose.
The ubuntu-latest label will migrate to Ubuntu \d+
